{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>No Up. No Down.\u00a0No turning back.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're trapped in a <strong>zero-gravity simulation</strong>, armed with only a hatchet, a chain, and a fire extinguisher. <strong>Your goal?</strong> Traverse floating debris, recover lost audio logs, and <strong>escape alive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every move counts. One wrong impulse could send you drifting into the void\u2026 <strong>forcing you to restart the level from scratch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This title combines <strong>first-person platforming</strong> with a fragmented narrative told through scattered recordings from your lost crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique physics-based mechanics</strong>: push, grab, and launch yourself in zero gravity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Minimalist visuals</strong> with a realistic space atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging level design:</strong> each stage tests your skill and patience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Environmental storytelling:</strong> uncover what happened to your ship and your crew.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed for players who thrive on <strong>intense challenges</strong> and love <strong>precision mechanics</strong> and <strong>speedruns</strong>, this game pushes you to <strong>beat your own limits.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&gt; By the way\u2026 my best time is 25 minutes. <strong>Think you can beat it?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640640?t=1745515727","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640640/c0c47613b6b5a549546d288fa275646a2b3ef2a7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745515727","capsule_im